    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/fcf60bfb194eba2ed7b2c185a615d282.avif?t=1754034632\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/481e9be3978e026cce1aa82a76905be0.poster.avif?t=1754034632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/481e9be3978e026cce1aa82a76905be0.webm?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/481e9be3978e026cce1aa82a76905be0.mp4?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Land on an alien world with nothing but your wits, your tools, and your drive to thrive. Build, explore, and automate in this sci-fi resource management game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/a3c6965846cee3dbcd8c1a6787c40422.avif?t=1754034632\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/5c74ec2f23c5034fc6e90d26db8a35fa.poster.avif?t=1754034632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/5c74ec2f23c5034fc6e90d26db8a35fa.webm?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/5c74ec2f23c5034fc6e90d26db8a35fa.mp4?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From humble beginnings to a sprawling space base! Construct your base from scratch using anything you can find - from primitive resources to unknown alien materials. Unlock blueprints, optimize your workflow with automation, and push deeper into outer space! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/f026f8ec7ed6648bc307bfdf20ba8d75.avif?t=1754034632\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/b5ba664c8d0a681c3edf02a8f835e074.poster.avif?t=1754034632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/b5ba664c8d0a681c3edf02a8f835e074.webm?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/b5ba664c8d0a681c3edf02a8f835e074.mp4?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the mysteries of distant worlds. From ancient relics to strange ecosystems, each planet holds its own set of secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/40ec95c298de4185e875a2b7cca795de.avif?t=1754034632\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/95e3ee02f8e871a261559b68bbc23e66.poster.avif?t=1754034632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/95e3ee02f8e871a261559b68bbc23e66.webm?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/95e3ee02f8e871a261559b68bbc23e66.mp4?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not every species welcomes visitors. Hostile wildlife and territorial species won\u2019t let you exploit their planet without a fight - have your loyal robot companion O.P.H.E.L.I.A and laser guns at hand!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/7f0944f1d5eb122c7d65a50507538e04.avif?t=1754034632\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/976cbd07a4f762e95ddf6c03b7d96296.poster.avif?t=1754034632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/976cbd07a4f762e95ddf6c03b7d96296.webm?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/976cbd07a4f762e95ddf6c03b7d96296.mp4?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover colonies across the stellar system and participate in intergalactic cooperation. Aid them, trade with them, or learn from them as you discover your place in the galaxy. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/fcf60bfb194eba2ed7b2c185a615d282.avif?t=1754034632\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/481e9be3978e026cce1aa82a76905be0.poster.avif?t=1754034632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/481e9be3978e026cce1aa82a76905be0.webm?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/481e9be3978e026cce1aa82a76905be0.mp4?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Land on an alien world with nothing but your wits, your tools, and your drive to thrive. Build, explore, and automate in this sci-fi resource management game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/a3c6965846cee3dbcd8c1a6787c40422.avif?t=1754034632\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/5c74ec2f23c5034fc6e90d26db8a35fa.poster.avif?t=1754034632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/5c74ec2f23c5034fc6e90d26db8a35fa.webm?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/5c74ec2f23c5034fc6e90d26db8a35fa.mp4?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From humble beginnings to a sprawling space base! Construct your base from scratch using anything you can find - from primitive resources to unknown alien materials. Unlock blueprints, optimize your workflow with automation, and push deeper into outer space! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/f026f8ec7ed6648bc307bfdf20ba8d75.avif?t=1754034632\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/b5ba664c8d0a681c3edf02a8f835e074.poster.avif?t=1754034632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/b5ba664c8d0a681c3edf02a8f835e074.webm?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/b5ba664c8d0a681c3edf02a8f835e074.mp4?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover the mysteries of distant worlds. From ancient relics to strange ecosystems, each planet holds its own set of secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/40ec95c298de4185e875a2b7cca795de.avif?t=1754034632\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/95e3ee02f8e871a261559b68bbc23e66.poster.avif?t=1754034632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/95e3ee02f8e871a261559b68bbc23e66.webm?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/95e3ee02f8e871a261559b68bbc23e66.mp4?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not every species welcomes visitors. Hostile wildlife and territorial species won\u2019t let you exploit their planet without a fight - have your loyal robot companion O.P.H.E.L.I.A and laser guns at hand!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/7f0944f1d5eb122c7d65a50507538e04.avif?t=1754034632\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/976cbd07a4f762e95ddf6c03b7d96296.poster.avif?t=1754034632\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/976cbd07a4f762e95ddf6c03b7d96296.webm?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1928080/extras/976cbd07a4f762e95ddf6c03b7d96296.mp4?t=1754034632\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover colonies across the stellar system and participate in intergalactic cooperation. Aid them, trade with them, or learn from them as you discover your place in the galaxy. </p>",
